# Quantities and units:
# - Progenitor mass: Msun
# - Dust mass per composition: Msun
#
# Data organization:
# - Section headers identify SN channels/configurations.
# - Composition headers identify each dust species.
# - Numeric rows are: progenitor_mass, dust_mass
#
